{
  "id": "HEB.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "HEB",
  "reference": "Heb. 10",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Christ's Sacrifice Once for All",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The law is only a shadow of the good things that are coming—not the realities themselves. For this reason it can never, by the same sacrifices repeated endlessly year after year, make perfect those who draw near to worship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otherwise, would they not have stopped being offered? For the worshipers would have been cleansed once for all, and would no longer have felt guilty for their sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But those sacrifices are an annual reminder of sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is impossible for the blood of bulls and goats to take away sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, when Christ came into the world, he said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Sacrifice and offering you did not desire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but a body you prepared for me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with burnt offerings and sin offerings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you were not pleased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said, 'Here I am—it is written about me in the scroll—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I have come to do your will, my God.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "First he said, \"Sacrifices and offerings, burnt offerings and sin offerings you did not desire, nor were you pleased with them\"—though they were offered in accordance with the law.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said, \"Here I am, I have come to do your will.\" He sets aside the first to establish the second.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And by that will, we have been made holy through the sacrifice of the body of Jesus Christ once for all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Day after day every priest stands and performs his religious duties; again and again he offers the same sacrifices, which can never take away sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when this priest had offered for all time one sacrifice for sins, he sat down at the right hand of God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and since that time he waits for his enemies to be made his footstool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For by one sacrifice he has made perfect forever those who are being made holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Holy Spirit also testifies to us about this. First he says:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is the covenant I will make with them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "after that time, says the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will put my laws in their hearts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will write them on their minds.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he adds:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Their sins and lawless acts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will remember no more.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And where these have been forgiven, sacrifice for sin is no longer necessary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Call to Persevere in Faith",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, brothers and sisters, since we have confidence to enter the Most Holy Place by the blood of Jesus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by a new and living way opened for us through the curtain, that is, his body,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and since we have a great priest over the house of God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let us draw near to God with a sincere heart and with the full assurance that faith brings, having our hearts sprinkled to cleanse us from a guilty conscience and having our bodies washed with pure water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us hold unswervingly to the hope we profess, for he who promised is faithful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let us consider how we may spur one another on toward love and good deeds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not giving up meeting together, as some are in the habit of doing, but encouraging one another—and all the more as you see the Day approaching.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If we deliberately keep on sinning after we have received the knowledge of the truth, no sacrifice for sins is left,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but only a fearful expectation of judgment and of raging fire that will consume the enemies of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who rejected the law of Moses died without mercy on the testimony of two or three witnesses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How much more severely do you think someone deserves to be punished who has trampled the Son of God underfoot, who has treated as an unholy thing the blood of the covenant that sanctified them, and who has insulted the Spirit of grace?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we know him who said, \"It is mine to avenge; I will repay,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and again, \"The Lord will judge his people.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a dreadful thing to fall into the hands of the living God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember those earlier days after you had received the light, when you endured in a great conflict full of suffering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes you were publicly exposed to insult and persecution; at other times you stood side by side with those who were so treated.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You suffered along with those in prison and joyfully accepted the confiscation of your property, because you knew that you yourselves had better and lasting possessions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So do not throw away your confidence; it will be richly rewarded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You need to persevere so that when you have done the will of God, you will receive what he has promised.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In just a little while,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he who is coming will come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and will not delay.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"But my righteous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "one will live by faith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "And I take no pleasure",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in the one who shrinks back.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But we do not belong to those who shrink back and are destroyed, but to those who have faith and are saved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
